    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ffb8f6b561d0fd8c373e1bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，目标就是在新马级\n取得超过两次胜利。\n要挑战Pre-OP以上的竞赛，提升知名度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adf99ee1a22dd252aba0933a1ee93825c57d669e9165b78a5d4fcad584d44dc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046420.json",
