    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e84af7f0959dc81276fbb669",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰在比赛中持续拿下好成绩。\n她的知名度逐渐提升，举办街头演唱会时\n也越来越多人停下来观赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d91f5ccca280f1808c22286e63fa41ac174f6d15a3d78e624d7de8420c81b7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
