    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db145c048faf7451f9f390fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是她不擅长的草地赛道。而且经典三冠\n还是聚集了该世代顶尖赛马娘的竞赛。\n要取胜十分困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f21c1802ba412e861a2e518223a7d794b4fcf11b9e3a6161463b356d48837f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046421.json",
      "json_path": [
