      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她还是决定要挑战“皋月赏”。\n为了演唱只有经典三冠的舞台\n才能唱的歌曲给粉丝听──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2ea1432dfb5c1dd9298dad47de8ba2394439aaef9bd613dcc7479b39060a92d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046421.json",
      "json_path": [
